 */

/** @page mptk_synth_overview MPTK Synth Overview
 *  @ingroup synth_engine_core
 *  @brief Core concept and lifecycle of the shared synthesizer.
 *
 *  @section mptk_synth_core Core Concept
 *  - MidiSynth is the shared sample-based SoundFont synthesizer (C# port/adaptation of FluidSynth) used by all playback prefabs.
 *  - Classes such as @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiFilePlayer , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiStreamPlayer , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiInReader , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiListPlayer , and @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiExternalPlayer inherit MidiSynth, exposing its properties and methods.
 *  - The synth loads a SoundFont, processes MIDI events, allocates voices, applies SoundFont or Unity effects, and renders audio.
 *
 *  @section mptk_synth_adaptation FluidSynth Heritage and Unity Adaptation
 *  - The DSP and SoundFont synthesis model originates from FluidSynth and is adapted in C# for Maestro MPTK.
 *  - Audio rendering is integrated with Unity playback flow, including AudioSource-compatible usage.
 *  - MIDI scheduling and audio processing are coordinated with Unity runtime constraints.
 *  - MPTK adds real-time control extensions for interactive and gameplay-driven music systems.
 *
 *  @section mptk_synth_use Accessing Synth Features
 *  - Common properties: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MPTK_Volume "MPTK_Volume" , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MPTK_Transpose "MPTK_Transpose" , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MPTK_SynthRate "MPTK_SynthRate".
 *  - Reinitialize channels/modulators when swapping SoundFonts: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_InitSynth .
 *  - Performance tuning: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_ThreadMidiPriority , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_ThreadMidiWait , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_AutoBuffer .
 *
 *  @par Related runtime module
 *  - @ref synth_engine_runtime
 *
 *  @section mptk_synth_lifecycle Lifecycle
 *  1. Prefab loads and creates a MidiSynth instance.
 *  2. @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_InitSynth prepares channels, voices, and modulators.
 *  3. MIDI sequencer feeds events (file, stream, or external input).
 *  4. Voices are rendered in OnAudioFilterRead; statistics available via fields such as @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.StatAudioFilterReadMS .
 *
 *  @section mptk_synth_links Related Topics
 *  - Maestro Pro additions: @ref maestro_pro_features
 *  - Pro runtime module: @ref synth_engine_pro
 *  - Spatial audio module: @ref synth_spatial_audio
 *  - Spatial workflow: @ref mptk_spatial_audio_workflow
 *  - SoundFont management: @ref soundfont_management_hub
 *  - Audio settings and latency: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth (Audio Settings section in class docs)
 */

